      "value": "<p local-id=\"0aef60baa716\">Requirements extracted from Zimmermann Functional Requirements excel, downloaded July 3rd, 2026 after all requirements were confirmed. This page lists all third-party integrations within scope for the Zimmermann SFCC platform.</p><table ac:local-id=\"e216076f59a6\" data-layout=\"full-width\" data-table-width=\"1800\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 163.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 160.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 1077.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 400.0px;\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"d400f9a54e89\"><th ac:local-id=\"60caac270ce8\"><p local-id=\"82062751c23b\">Category</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"003b28ecebae\"><p local-id=\"ab2d77148712\">Third Party</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"64108e48-bf56-4deb-9764-83aa193281d0\"><p local-id=\"569abc7964a3\">Requirement</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"166147989455\"><p local-id=\"d5b6e58a53e5\"><strong>Comments</strong></p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"e0a0a1e5e0ae\"><td ac:local-id=\"1f5265e9a672\"><p local-id=\"93a0536f02db\">CMS</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"55f783ae123e\"><p local-id=\"86648da07ca5\">Contentful</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"7fed7f75-669b-4823-bebd-c2c07b71df0f\"><p local-id=\"cad51b6d1f35\">The system will integrate with Contentful as the headless CMS via the Salesforce App Exchange connector, consuming content via the Contentful delivery API for all customer-facing pages across all regional storefronts</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"895b44a227fc\"><p local-id=\"82ffdf771f1f\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"a21d55ffb116\"><td ac:local-id=\"c761a4037dfb\"><p local-id=\"ce3b59bc2fc7\">Integration Platform</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"66a717dbc14f\"><p local-id=\"a35effb1a4a6\">MuleSoft</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"009eefb1-ec48-417c-84e2-3d7cd0331f76\"><p local-id=\"56c80db541bc\">The system will consume MuleSoft APIs via MRT API connections for all integration touchpoints including product, price, inventory, order, customer and returns data flows between SFCC and downstream systems</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"e2cfee02b214\"><p local-id=\"67a6babdd447\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"d32c89c51e84\"><td ac:local-id=\"a4f987708b21\"><p local-id=\"2be8d32b2958\">Product Data</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"428942514678\"><p local-id=\"d2d16e262dd3\">AP21</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"8f8e4795-f649-4283-abda-779882cb5b1e\"><p local-id=\"7c6d495b1f12\">The system will consume product data, pricebook and inventory feeds from AP21 via MuleSoft using MRT API connections</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"8ab10deeb9a8\"><p local-id=\"eea27c4b9041\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"6a81aa4ba4b1\"><td ac:local-id=\"6fa44c2fbd73\"><p local-id=\"a91f970260db\">OMS</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f72e13541f11\"><p local-id=\"5038bd057cfd\">NewStore</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"02ff03db-7174-4330-a8ba-f9cdcdc0a2de\"><p local-id=\"8c047af9bc05\">The system will pass order data to NewStore via MuleSoft using MRT API connections. NewStore is the primary OMS — markets not yet on NewStore will route to AP21 until migration is complete</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"ae86f235e533\"><p local-id=\"a7de04dee9ed\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"24c07e20898f\"><td ac:local-id=\"25e0e8013135\"><p local-id=\"319fdc4994c2\">Payments</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a05ff331425f\"><p local-id=\"edbfcc94884d\">Adyen Drop-In</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"18d507a6-6e7d-4367-aabe-e0c05e54c8b0\"><p local-id=\"91d31bdfcaba\">The system will integrate with Adyen Drop-In via the Salesforce Payments account sync, supporting credit and debit card, PayPal, Apple Pay and Google Pay across all domestic storefronts</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"2799f448099c\"><p local-id=\"40bab7322fe6\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"8f627685d935\"><td ac:local-id=\"f78d44bd187a\"><p local-id=\"bb3bad032aef\">Payments</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"d14f791eacfb\"><p local-id=\"134e162a3546\">Klarna</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"bb0bfa85-df88-4d4d-871f-91413c4fda00\"><p local-id=\"a9d07c522215\">The system will support Klarna BNPL on AU and US storefronts via the Adyen connector per the roadmap agreed at discovery</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"24d0c732c531\"><p local-id=\"988578da783e\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"985025ce060c\"><td ac:local-id=\"01a497fe59bc\"><p local-id=\"b003060476eb\">Gift Cards / Credit Notes</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"14b70a6d3ba3\"><p local-id=\"3dfb644d5c0c\">GiveX</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"28d91e75-b41a-494d-acc7-8e5f54654399\"><p local-id=\"b8f911a569ae\">The system will integrate with GiveX for gift card and credit note balance check via a direct MRT API connection. Gift card and credit note redemption will be handled via the NewStore adaptor through MuleSoft.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f2b304bc7ece\"><p local-id=\"ce88fdb0053a\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"3394775e525d\"><td ac:local-id=\"3c4056f4077c\"><p local-id=\"d69dac234bac\">Retail Rewards</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"355abe20caaa\"><p local-id=\"21dbea42ca95\">AP21</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"3f34bc29-4680-4c25-b53e-6284aa756db4\"><p local-id=\"11950bd607eb\">The system will integrate with AP21 via MuleSoft for Retail Rewards balance retrieval and redemption at the payment step</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"dea3d4316d98\"><p local-id=\"4883619e38ab\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"1413cf82510b\"><td ac:local-id=\"a91538da45b3\"><p local-id=\"9c5c48efcdc9\">Search and Recommendations</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a2fdfef01e76\"><p local-id=\"1725f6a4fbc3\">Salesforce Einstein</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"0e381021-d433-4cc5-b9e6-a8a5054cf47a\"><p local-id=\"f27cbc6b116f\">The system will use Salesforce Einstein for all search, merchandising and product recommendation functionality across all storefronts, enabled natively within the Salesforce platform</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f93ca3882efc\"><p local-id=\"19bbb22e0e62\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"96d2ae6237e3\"><td ac:local-id=\"ca4608b42e93\"><p local-id=\"59f3e1a8eb28\">Customer</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"e451b3465f15\"><p local-id=\"2e03fca1c879\">Omneo</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"7835fe15-baf7-4519-a106-c3c6252988de\"><p local-id=\"3b6785e65a99\">The system will maintain a bidirectional sync with Omneo as the customer system of record via webhooks, covering customer profile, address, loyalty status and communication preferences</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"1cd9ffe4e3ca\"><p local-id=\"5bef0a6b27a3\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"4429f5484f0d\"><td ac:local-id=\"b1903496a9d4\"><p local-id=\"23aa69fa04ae\">Returns</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"65b7516cfaae\"><p local-id=\"9ba5345f4add\">Narvar</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4c4cb563-ed1d-486e-a48c-37bb83c30286\"><p local-id=\"2c21d8645c41\">The system will redirect customers to Narvar for domestic returns initiation. No SFCC build is required beyond the redirect link — returns processing is owned entirely by Narvar</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"8b3fdf8f3342\"><p local-id=\"e4db024c92f8\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"2344b649bbc4\"><td ac:local-id=\"de35f2d0ff36\"><p local-id=\"f2e7570e1cf7\">Tracking</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"9d0cc5302bc0\"><p local-id=\"0505f00f9124\">Narvar</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4fd11cb9-832e-4f97-9302-359956d55a7e\"><p local-id=\"0de5198a97b4\">The system will pass order and shipment data to Narvar via MuleSoft to support order tracking. The system will integrate with the Narvar CONVERT widget to display estimated delivery dates at the checkout delivery step and on the PDP</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"eb9f31908759\"><p local-id=\"088ed28f0342\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"d203215bc221\"><td ac:local-id=\"ad277ffdb555\"><p local-id=\"7533c0351781\">International</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"1ec2deeac967\"><p local-id=\"797e6f96ac9b\">Global-e</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"d24d2a62-864b-41e3-9e5d-e25bbbc79529\"><p local-id=\"0ed17847f461\">The system will integrate with Global-e for cross-border checkout via the Global-e vendor cartridge and iframe injection. Global-e will own all international checkout, payment and tax processing for HK, ME, US international and EU international storefronts</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"bd5349043f6f\"><p local-id=\"01f8723d295a\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"8626a067d178\"><td ac:local-id=\"4dea1771113d\"><p local-id=\"b2d67b9a4229\">Returns</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"ebc7e85f9fe5\"><p local-id=\"305d5fe9ec0f\">Global-e</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"5d82cfe9-5430-4ef0-8cca-1d782ceb4b7a\"><p local-id=\"67fcb852e1b5\">The system will redirect customers to Global-e for international returns</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"43b6158b18ec\"><p local-id=\"9afeb4018d22\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"8dd699ff5706\"><td ac:local-id=\"305da06b250e\"><p local-id=\"3cf4853236c1\">Tax</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"308e7b67857e\"><p local-id=\"6eb8962439bf\">Avalara</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"237c7119-84df-4f65-9b91-973a55e4be5a\"><p local-id=\"43b693ffddad\">The system will integrate with Avalara for tax calculation on US domestic, New Zealand and New Caledonia and EU domestic orders via SFCC hooks and the Avalara cartridge. All other domestic storefronts will use SFCC native tax tables</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f50dfc1580d5\"><p local-id=\"a37ed9860ba6\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"f32dc3c88f2b\"><td ac:local-id=\"0e798f5eb687\"><p local-id=\"79038eaad4ef\">Address</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f2ad78a20608\"><p local-id=\"6416b496bebc\">Google Places</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"aeaf37a2-8768-4ec6-967e-dcbb53ba9b48\"><p local-id=\"7921b21c926f\">The system will integrate with Google Places via MRT API connection for delivery and billing address autocomplete and validation across all domestic storefronts, replacing the existing PCA Predict integration</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"1767d100d3e2\"><p local-id=\"497d16474acf\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"b15262199e58\"><td ac:local-id=\"9c7c7231570a\"><p local-id=\"1bd0574d60dc\">Maps and Boutique Info</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f30248361d80\"><p local-id=\"61d9446328e1\">Google Maps</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"b53ef5bc-775c-4303-83b9-4df0f64fd353\"><p local-id=\"7e5a31fdeea3\">The system will integrate with Google Maps via MRT API connection to display store locations and directions on the store locator and Find in Boutique functionality</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"0f286e602537\"><p local-id=\"f2478384b9d5\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"90623f7e1cdf\"><td ac:local-id=\"10399f0d9847\"><p local-id=\"709ad546df4b\">Maps and Boutique Info</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"5fffa246ec0d\"><p local-id=\"a78818eeb453\">Google Business API</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"e42bbce1-af6f-4346-be1d-7c2d134f50ca\"><p local-id=\"d470e4852206\">The system will integrate with the Google Business API to retrieve and display store opening hours, with a manual override option available in SFCC Business Manager</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"7b9904211623\"><p local-id=\"a28e5d708b74\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"f4a0b7be5760\"><td ac:local-id=\"45f84ee94bbd\"><p local-id=\"6a362fa7db55\">Consent and Privacy</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"d8765bd21513\"><p local-id=\"6596937fd8ce\">Didomi</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"49497e6d-5b21-470f-9dab-ee4ccfa03bf3\"><p local-id=\"f2f079e6d5c0\">The system will integrate with Didomi as the consent management platform, presenting a cookie consent banner on first visit across all storefronts and persisting consent preferences across sessions. The system will ensure GTM and Didomi are correctly integrated within the SFCC PWA Kit to support Google Consent Mode v2 signal passing. Third-party tracking and marketing scripts will only load after customer consent is granted. Didomi configuration and tag-layer gating are out of scope for SFCC and remain with Zimmermann.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"23e9a06fb87b\"><p local-id=\"6b173c0d8af0\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"a02a6d444250\"><td ac:local-id=\"3bbc80fd9c2e\"><p local-id=\"172371a1eb5e\">Media</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"88ddd8dd27fc\"><p local-id=\"898b9e88db68\">Vimeo</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"96f149cd-dd42-4dae-9a10-f2ebde7bcf97\"><p local-id=\"7df36e0508d3\">The system will support Vimeo video content on the PDP and editorial pages via URL embed with the embed URL stored in the product data or CMS</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"6137054cbfb7\"><p local-id=\"9ce82c2fdcd2\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"b59943a1a671\"><td ac:local-id=\"646fc0d3932d\"><p local-id=\"849b44204250\">Analytics and Tagging</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a61da8c5276d\"><p local-id=\"71e65393f586\">Google Tag Manager</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"c5985e48-0752-4f6f-92f2-c69d12048320\"><p local-id=\"9a874cd8fc59\">The system will load the GTM container snippet on all storefront pages across all regional sites via the AddingWell MRT integration. The system will populate a well-structured data layer as the single source of truth for all downstream analytics and marketing tags. GTM container logic, tag firing rules and AddingWell container configuration are out of scope for SFCC and remain with Zimmermann.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4aa231f78849\"><p local-id=\"c2eacff88e06\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"abde89c04181\"><td ac:local-id=\"f7e73f852b4c\"><p local-id=\"d8f480622e42\">Analytics and Tagging</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"399dc7eaa330\"><p local-id=\"95628e53ca3c\">Google Analytics 4</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a950eec8-3ee6-4bb8-b192-2c5c9e31a1a5\"><p local-id=\"f37929cf014d\">The system will pass commerce and customer events to Google Analytics 4 via the GTM data layer and AddingWell server-side container. GA4 configuration and tag setup are out of scope for SFCC and remain with Zimmermann.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"630ee3e09881\"><p local-id=\"04706bab8dcf\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"4fa73aa4bfd3\"><td ac:local-id=\"0a26904ac844\"><p local-id=\"0558f27a3dce\">Product Feeds</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"0ee9620b9422\"><p local-id=\"27e2cc7794bf\">Feedonomics</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"7b37e71d-2b5d-463a-ad2b-e625a1fd5a79\"><p local-id=\"3114cbcd27d5\">The system will run scheduled SFCC Business Manager jobs to export product catalogue feeds to Feedonomics including product availability, stock positions, pricing, visibility, labels and metadata. Feed configuration, product feed management and Google Merchant Centre setup are out of scope for SFCC and remain with Zimmermann.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"53a3231d8754\"><p local-id=\"ed19569f55f0\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"c63586a31d24\"><td ac:local-id=\"082e53ce664a\"><p local-id=\"dd2c10c4b2db\">Product Feeds</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"3f1df0363ec3\"><p local-id=\"82b4e9264fc3\">Lengow</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"553aad47-3e00-4334-8e78-f264e01a4a60\"><p local-id=\"1cb6d57095b8\">The system will run scheduled SFCC Business Manager jobs to export product catalogue feeds to Lengow including product availability, stock positions, pricing, visibility, labels and metadata. Feed configuration and product feed management are out of scope for SFCC and remain with Zimmermann.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"464200e4dbef\"><p local-id=\"1a49384599b5\">decommissioned</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"b66b70a80d62\"><td ac:local-id=\"b8413388203c\"><p local-id=\"23ef776516f7\">Boutique Appointments</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"afcf0c0b5d81\"><p local-id=\"b2f2790d1ade\">Booksy</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"ce738036-8e8b-4737-842f-cbb2235bc8cc\"><p local-id=\"00a75005b1a1\">The system will integrate with Booksy via MRT API connection to retrieve and display boutique appointment history within the My Account area</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"60b77ed7aa5a\"><p local-id=\"39e68e19b8ff\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"5b8a09cacf7a\"><td ac:local-id=\"7848de1256aa\"><p local-id=\"2032d2a388a7\">Live Chat</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"7e7f752f6cd1\"><p local-id=\"f3775e810b69\">Inside Chat</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4ee6e852-141e-43c6-8b9b-5527b14b68fa\"><p local-id=\"a7d1dae78487\">The system will support Inside Chat live chat widget loading via GTM script injection through the AddingWell container. Inside Chat configuration and routing logic are out of scope for SFCC and remain with Zimmermann.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"87f641aecff3\"><p local-id=\"1204440996df\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"c659c63cc6ed\"><td ac:local-id=\"6c5478038d94\"><p local-id=\"4b2e532d0ea0\">Sizing</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"c09e3c6c11d2\"><p local-id=\"8a65a6ee2ea3\">Measmerize</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"476d8850-476f-4b1f-a5a5-1a6205128396\"><p local-id=\"1b40e68fe515\">The system will embed the Measmerize widget on the PDP via script injection and update the Find My Size CTA to display the recommended size once a recommendation has been generated by Measmerize. Measmerize widget configuration and size guide content are out of scope for SFCC and remain with Zimmermann and Measmerize.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"68ab0d9bb344\"><p local-id=\"d32f9dc7dcbf\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"28ad84ec14e2\"><td ac:local-id=\"6c6cbb3b5c9b\"><p local-id=\"593e58ec278b\">A/B Testing</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"45810b0e6c0b\"><p local-id=\"0271ed400ad7\">Optimizely</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"336bf520-2217-4958-b77a-9857404c8c70\"><p local-id=\"298694250f7a\">The system will support Optimizely A/B testing by ensuring the data layer includes required audience segmentation attributes. Optimizely script loading and audience configuration are managed via GTM and AddingWell — out of scope for SFCC.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"06a8b382e93b\"><p local-id=\"7dc8f0000c30\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"7e7a3edc3dc5\"><td ac:local-id=\"a5aed3a089e2\"><p local-id=\"4e564f33ad32\">Heatmapping</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"8c335dae57aa\"><p local-id=\"8c98565a2dcf\">Crazy Egg</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"0ebc1fc4-0378-4f95-bb05-d6b49da33c8f\"><p local-id=\"236f398e8574\">The system will support Crazy Egg heatmapping by ensuring the data layer includes page type, authenticated state and storefront region. Crazy Egg script loading and segmentation configuration are managed via GTM and AddingWell — out of scope for SFCC.<br/></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"ebccefffc08a\"><p local-id=\"98e8a7b12327\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"472f5b025ad2\"><td ac:local-id=\"2e2601007964\"><p local-id=\"ae552410821a\">Analytics</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"6d10ccb1311a\"><p local-id=\"44f4ad7a5db2\">AddingWell</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"5348d7f8-0e2d-4c63-ae1c-0ed46ad57f7b\"><p local-id=\"9fbd03d37216\">The system will support the AddingWell server-side container via Salesforce MRT integration for analytics event routing. AddingWell container configuration and tag routing logic is out of scope for SFCC and remains with Zimmermann</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"b0302dbc738e\"><p local-id=\"d1d81c8a6b3c\"></p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"341f1f6a7d11\"><td ac:local-id=\"1980993c75ac\"><p local-id=\"ec780dacac46\">Support</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"3a40f96215a5\"><p local-id=\"50953df01d72\">Zendesk</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"46cde5c0-5ab9-4fd7-add9-0ed458b3d1ff\"><p local-id=\"0a897c21660e\">The system will integrate with Zendesk via MuleSoft integration to support customer service functionality on the storefront. Zendesk platform configuration and widget setup is out of scope for SFCC and remains with Zimmermann</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"ea568b605a13\"><p local-id=\"9767f40e9fe6\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
